				<p>MINOR FLOOD PEAK EXPECTED AT BARRINGUN ON WEDNESDAY AFTERNOON</p>
<p>MINOR FLOODING POSSIBLE AT ENNGONIA FROM THURSDAY</p>

				<p/>
				<p>A flood peak from rain over the previous week in the Warrego Catchment in Queensland is now causing stream rises at Barringun where minor flooding is occurring. Further downstream, minor flooding possible at Enngonia from Thursday.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
